{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Squarepinski </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A Minimalist Puzzle with Maximum Charm</i><br><br><strong>Squarepinski</strong> is a cosy but challenging puzzle game that reinvents the classic jigsaw. In this geometric challenge, every piece is the humble square; but don\u2019t be fooled by their lack of tabs! Instead of relying on borders or corners, you'll be figuring out how big each piece needs to be, and which have been mirrored! It's jigsaw puzzling... but not as you know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819570/extras/Screenshot_2025-06-17_162052.png?t=1750324057\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Drawn Whimsy</strong><br>Enjoy original, hand-drawn artwork, specifically designed for this unique puzzle format. Solve\u00a0 charming scenes of animals doing delightfully human things, like badgers serving beers or cows playing poker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819570/extras/Screenshot_2025-06-17_161851.png?t=1750324057\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax and Unwind</strong><br>With soft sounds and a cozy, relaxed vibe, <strong>Squarepinski</strong> offers a peaceful space to unwind and engage your brain at your own pace. No timer. No Pressure. Just you, a charming puzzle, and a warm cup of whimsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What's in the Demo?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Curated puzzle packs to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upload and &quot;fractalise&quot; 3 of your own images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A taste of the secrets and hidden levels...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What's in the Main Game?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Unique puzzle packs (with more to come as DLC in the future)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlimited custom image uploads!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even more secrets...</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819570?t=1750324057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819570/49c17bcb87bfc8494cf4f7e6438e5bedb206a9d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750324057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819570/0ebb5b54b6f2ddeb26a785e50ce8cd71c0c0e72e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750324057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819570/0ebb5b54b6f2ddeb26a785e50ce8cd71c0c0e72e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750324057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Squarepinski </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A Minimalist Puzzle with Maximum Charm</i><br><br><strong>Squarepinski</strong> is a cosy but challenging puzzle game that reinvents the classic jigsaw. In this geometric challenge, every piece is the humble square; but don\u2019t be fooled by their lack of tabs! Instead of relying on borders or corners, you'll be figuring out how big each piece needs to be, and which have been mirrored! It's jigsaw puzzling... but not as you know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s